;SPLICE: READ ANOTHER 1D INPUT UFILE ? (Y/N; Q EXITS PROGRAM):$
*T ==> the "splice" utility patches together 1d Ufiles on a common x axis
*T ==> input 1d Ufile x axes can overlap or be disjoint
;SPLICE: READ ANOTHER 1D INPUT UFILE ? (Y/N; Q EXITS PROGRAM):$
Y
;UFNTER:  ENTER OPCODE (D/E/F/P/S/Q... ):$
F Z VS1 Q
;SPLICE:  ENTER 5 DIGIT SHOT #, "Q" TO BACK UP$
37065
;SPLICE: READ ANOTHER 1D INPUT UFILE ? (Y/N; Q EXITS PROGRAM):$
Y
;UFNTER:  ENTER OPCODE (D/E/F/P/S/Q... ):$
F Z VS2 Q
;SPLICE:  ENTER 5 DIGIT SHOT #, "Q" TO BACK UP$
37065
